{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/ABOUT_SECTION_GRAPHIC.gif?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VTumbler brings your favorite Oshi to the world of Arcade Puzzle Fighting! Brought to you by FeFe and friends, you can compete for the strategic win with your friends, random strangers, or train with a CPU! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/CHARACTER_SELECT_IMAGE.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/ONLINE_PVP.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Online Modes, you can invite a friend or queue up against a random stranger to compete against. Do your best and beat them and their favorite Oshi with yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VTumbler is played for the best of 3 rounds, so you've gotta win 2. Either tactically stack gems, create power gems and explode them to surprise your opponent with a massive stack of counter gems, or constantly pressure them with little &quot;presents&quot; on their game board. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful and watch your and your opponents game boards, the tide of battle can turn any second! Player vs. Player is bound to get your blood pumping, especially when your opponent takes all the gems you sent over and sends them right back at you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/VS.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/TRAINING_MODE.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you new to VTumbler and Puzzle Fighter games? We've got a relatively easy training mode set up just for you! This lets you experience the full extent of gameplay VTumbler has to offer, including seeing all the cute animations from your favorite VTuber. The Training CPU only does basic strategizing, but it knows how to randomly crack a jackpot and put you under pressure if you're not careful. Use training mode to get a feeling for the game and hop into online play afterwards to show everyone what you got!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/CHARACTERS_TITLE.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/FEFE_PROFILE_NO_LOGO.gif?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/CHIBIDOKI_PROFILE_NO_LOGO.gif?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/FREAM_CHARACTER_PROFILE_NO_LOGO.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/OBKATIEKAT_CHARACTER_PROFILE_NO_LOGO.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/COTTONTAIL__CHARACTER_PROFILE_NO_LOGO.png?t=1736000037\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/FEATURES.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Online Versus Friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Online Versus Randoms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Select</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Character Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stage Select</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle-Combat Gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/VTumbler-Teaser_resized.jpg?t=1736000037\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2744110?t=1736000037","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1736000037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/f37b86d105c3dcb49e5f9b265592f8af515cd69d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736000037","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/f37b86d105c3dcb49e5f9b265592f8af515cd69d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736000037","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"VTumbler contains some violence."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3262930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Now on Kickstarter!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/STEAM_PAGE__BACK_US_NOW_ON_KICKSTARTER_A.png?t=1736000037\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/ABOUT_SECTION_GRAPHIC.gif?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VTumbler brings your favorite Oshi to the world of Arcade Puzzle Fighting! Brought to you by FeFe and friends, you can compete for the strategic win with your friends, random strangers, or train with a CPU! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/CHARACTER_SELECT_IMAGE.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/ONLINE_PVP.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Online Modes, you can invite a friend or queue up against a random stranger to compete against. Do your best and beat them and their favorite Oshi with yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VTumbler is played for the best of 3 rounds, so you've gotta win 2. Either tactically stack gems, create power gems and explode them to surprise your opponent with a massive stack of counter gems, or constantly pressure them with little &quot;presents&quot; on their game board. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful and watch your and your opponents game boards, the tide of battle can turn any second! Player vs. Player is bound to get your blood pumping, especially when your opponent takes all the gems you sent over and sends them right back at you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/VS.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/TRAINING_MODE.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you new to VTumbler and Puzzle Fighter games? We've got a relatively easy training mode set up just for you! This lets you experience the full extent of gameplay VTumbler has to offer, including seeing all the cute animations from your favorite VTuber. The Training CPU only does basic strategizing, but it knows how to randomly crack a jackpot and put you under pressure if you're not careful. Use training mode to get a feeling for the game and hop into online play afterwards to show everyone what you got!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/CHARACTERS_TITLE.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/FEFE_PROFILE_NO_LOGO.gif?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/CHIBIDOKI_PROFILE_NO_LOGO.gif?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/FREAM_CHARACTER_PROFILE_NO_LOGO.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/OBKATIEKAT_CHARACTER_PROFILE_NO_LOGO.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/COTTONTAIL__CHARACTER_PROFILE_NO_LOGO.png?t=1736000037\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/FEATURES.png?t=1736000037\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Online Versus Friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Online Versus Randoms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Select</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Character Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stage Select</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle-Combat Gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse